        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/apple-maps-generic-3d.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27 is packed with a wide array of new features for iPhone, including in Apple Maps. Here are the two tentpole iOS 27 features for Apple Maps, plus some miscellaneous improvements.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-maps,ios-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1055791\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/24/heres-everything-new-for-apple-maps-in-ios-27/#more-1055791\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
