        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2024/10/apple-card-fi.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Good news for Apple Card Savings Account users this morning. Apple and Goldman Sachs have increased the interest rate on the account from 3.4% to 3.5% today.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-card\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071156\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/23/apple-increases-interest-rate-for-apple-card-savings-account/#more-1071156\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
