        "content_text": "Every AI agent you run keeps what it learns to itself. Work through a problem with Claude Code in the morning, then ask Codex about it that afternoon, and the second agent has no idea the first one exists. Add a home-server agent like OpenClaw or Hermes into the mix, and you end up reexplaining [&#8230;]",
