        "content_text": "<h1>As the album that gave us \"Call Me When You're Sober\" and \"Lithium\" turns 20, Amy Lee looks back on the record that showed the world Evanescence was here to stay.</h1><p><img src=\"https://img.buzzfeed.com/buzzfeed-static/static/2026-08/28/23/thumb/pOddUwJ04.jpg?crop=2988:1992;6,0&resize=1250:830\" /></p><hr /><p><a href=\"https://www.buzzfeed.com/andrewfirriolo/evanescence-amy-lee-the-open-door-20th-anniversary-interview\">View Entire Post &rsaquo;</a></p>",
