        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/iphone-duo-video-shows-left-handed-use-for-new-model/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/iphone-duo-1.jpeg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iPhone Duo is <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/09/apple-confirms-iphone-duo-release-date-for-october-details-here/\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"1068741\">less than a month away</a>, but many prospective buyers are still wondering how well the device will work in left-handed use. Here’s a video that shows a left-handed example.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"iphone,iphone-duo\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071510\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/iphone-duo-video-shows-left-handed-use-for-new-model/#more-1071510\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
