        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/airpods-just-got-a-long-requested-feature-in-new-update/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/10-AirPods-EQ-iOS-27-Beta.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While it was overshadowed by <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/14/ios-27-now-available-features-compatible-iphones/\">release of iOS 27</a>, Apple also <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/14/apple-just-released-new-airpods-pro-3-firmware-more-for-ios-27/\">released</a> a new software update for AirPods this month. The update brings a long-requested feature to supported AirPods models: custom EQ.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"airpods,ios,ios-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1061046\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/25/airpods-just-got-a-long-requested-feature-in-new-update/#more-1061046\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
