        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/24/apple-tv-reveals-new-series-with-hugh-laurie-as-organized-crime-boss/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/the-wanted-man-hugh-laurie.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Wanted Man is a new Apple TV series that’s <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/tv-pr/news/2026/09/apple-tv-unveils-first-look-at-the-wanted-man-a-new-crime-drama-starring-and-executive-produced-by-hugh-laurie/\">just been announced</a> starring Hugh Laurie as an incarcerated crime boss who’s ready to make an escape. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-tv\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071385\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/24/apple-tv-reveals-new-series-with-hugh-laurie-as-organized-crime-boss/#more-1071385\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
