        "title": "‘Brothers,’ starring Matthew McConaughey and Woody Harrelson, premieres on Apple TV",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/22/brothers-starring-matthew-mcconaughey-and-woody-harrelson-premieres-on-apple-tv/",
