        "title": "Apple adds RAW support for 11 digital cameras across iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Vision Pro",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/22/apple-adds-raw-support-for-11-digital-cameras-across-iphone-ipad-mac-and-vision-pro/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/04/200MP-iPhone-camera-rumors-align-on-2028-release.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple today updated its <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/127493\">official list</a> of digital camera RAW formats supported across its platforms, adding support for 11 models from several manufacturers. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ios,ipados,macos,photography,visionos\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071117\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/22/apple-adds-raw-support-for-11-digital-cameras-across-iphone-ipad-mac-and-vision-pro/#more-1071117\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
        "type": "Technology",
        "source": "9to5Mac"
