        "title": "Brazil court tells Apple to add age checks for casino app purchases",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/22/brazil-court-tells-apple-to-add-age-checks-for-casino-app-purchases/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2024/12/brazil-app-store.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A Brazilian court has ordered Apple to tighten age controls around a casino-style app on the App Store, including requiring age verification before making in-app purchases. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"aapl,app-store\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071001\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/22/brazil-court-tells-apple-to-add-age-checks-for-casino-app-purchases/#more-1071001\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
