        "content_text": "It was a spy satellite, now NASA's new telescope has headed into space.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/science/2026-08-28/nancy-grace-roman-space-telescope-is-about-to-launch/107080044\">NASA has launched its latest space telescope, a repurposed spy satellite which accompanies the James Webb Space Telescope. So what is it, and why is it being used?</a>",
