        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2024/02/9to5mac-happy-hour-lead1.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Benjamin and Chance cover the week in Apple news, including hands-on with the new M6 Mac mini and AirPods 5, the first round of bug fixes for the new operating systems, Apple Music Hall, and more. </p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"http://9to5mac.com/join\">And in Happy Hour Plus</a>, we reflect on how Siri AI has fared in the real world so far. Subscribe at <a href=\"http://9to5mac.com/join\">9to5mac.com/join</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://quince.com/happyhour\">Sponsored by Quince</a>: Find your next fall favorites at Quince. Download the Quince app for app-exclusive offers, or visit <a href=\"https://quince.com/happyhour\">quince.com/happyhour</a>. Get free shipping on your order and 365-day returns. Now available in Canada and the UK, too.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4hcdF4I\">Sponsored by iMazing</a>: iMazing’s platform for data transfer and device management keeps getting better. Get 20% off iMazing with code 9TO5-SEP26-20OFF. </li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http://www.copilot.money/9to5mac\">Sponsored by Copilot Money</a>: Get two months free with code 9TO5MAC at <a href=\"http://www.copilot.money/9to5mac\">copilot.money/9to5mac</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://claritaspod.com/measure/dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pfx.vpixl.com/sla7w/pscrb.fm/rss/p/9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/HH-609.mp3\"></audio></figure>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"9to5mac-happy-hour,podcast\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071471\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/24/happy-hour-609/#more-1071471\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
