        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/24/macos-27-top-features-much-more-than-just-siri-ai-video/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Top-Features.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Although Apple’s revamped personal assistant is no doubt the <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/17/macos-27-golden-gate-siri-ai-top-features-apples-assistant-finally-comes-to-life-video/\">headlining feature in macOS 27 Golden Gate</a>, there are many other new features and refinements in this year’s update that don’t involve Siri AI. Read our post as I cherry-pick a few of my favorite new macOS 27 updates, and be sure to <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ECsIpRlXANc\">watch our video</a> as I walk through them all.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"macos-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071055\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/24/macos-27-top-features-much-more-than-just-siri-ai-video/#more-1071055\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
