        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/apple-maps-square-business-integration.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1500\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Square has <a href=\"https://squareup.com/us/en/press/apple-business\">announced</a> a new integration with Apple Business that should make Apple Maps better for both businesses and users. Here are the details.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-business,apple-maps,square\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071390\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/24/square-now-integrates-with-apple-business-to-improve-maps-listings/#more-1071390\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
