        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/claude.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Anthropic has released its latest AI model with Claude Opus 5.5. The new version arrives about two months after the previous Opus model upgrade, matching Anthropic’s previous upgrade cadence.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"ai,anthropic,claude\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1071021\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/09/22/anthropic-upgrades-claude-with-new-opus-5-5-model-details-here/#more-1071021\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
